      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW VERITY (1) produced a modest effort most recently when eighth at this track over 400m behind Onyx Lass (23.42) in a Grade 5. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. LANKY LARRY (8) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh (23.03) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 at this track. Has a good record here including five wins. The form out of his last race has been franked. Likely to be thereabouts. POWER AFFECT (7) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten half a length into second (22.90) at this track in a Grade 5 over 400m. Bold showing expected. PAW NATULLO (6) is worth some thought after placing last start.",
